the Dataset under one of the terms defined below.

"Commercial Use" means use of the Dataset, in whole or in part,
directly or indirectly, for the purpose of financial gain,
including but not limited to: integration into a commercial
product or service, use in a paid consulting engagement, use
to train models that are sold or licensed to third parties,
or use within a for-profit company's internal systems.

"Non-Commercial Use" means use strictly limited to personal
research, academic study, or open-source non-monetized projects.


2. FREE TIER (Sample — Hugging Face)

